## Surcharges
| Surcharge | Code | Basis | Amount | Effective from | Effective to | Comment |
| Fuel adjustment (first step) | FUEL-1 | % of day charges and lift moves after discount | 4.8% | 01.03.2024 | 30.06.2024 | quarterly review |
| Fuel adjustment (second step) | FUEL-2 | % of day charges and lift moves after discount | 5.6% | 01.07.2024 | 30.09.2024 | |
| Fuel adjustment (third step) | FUEL-3 | % of day charges and lift moves after discount | 5.1% | 2024-10-01 | 2024-12-31 | |
| Peak season I | PK-1 | EUR per box per day | 6.50 | 15.08.2024 | 31.10.2024 | berries and early citrus |
| Peak season II | PK-2 | EUR per box per day | 8.75 | 01.11.2024 | 15.02.2025 | citrus main season |
| Dangerous goods handling | DG-1 | EUR per box per move | 185.00 | 01.03.2024 | 28.02.2025 | all IMDG classes |
| DG class 6.1 supplement | DG-2 | EUR per box per move, on top of DG-1 | 95.00 | 01.03.2024 | 28.02.2025 | toxic substances only |
| Pharma temperature mapping | GDP-1 | EUR per container | 140.00 | 01.03.2024 | 28.02.2025 | for GDP-audited customers |
| Pre-trip inspection | PTI-1 | EUR per box | 63.50 | 01.03.2024 | 28.02.2025 | |
| Genset hire | GEN-1 | EUR per box per day | 54.00 | 01.03.2024 | 28.02.2025 | max 14 days |
| Late gate-in after cut-off | LG-1 | EUR per box | 72.00 | 01.03.2024 | 28.02.2025 | cut-off 16:30 local |
| Excess power draw | EN-1 | EUR per kW above 7.5 kW per day | 1.35 | 01.03.2024 | 28.02.2025 | metered at the plug |
| Currency adjustment | CAF-1 | % on invoices issued in PLN | 1.5% | 01.03.2024 | 28.02.2025 | applies if EUR/PLN moves more than 3.0% from the card reference of 4.3150 |
| NOTE | Fuel adjustment steps are reviewed by Finance (P. Venkataraman-Holt) at the end of each quarter, the step applies to invoices dated from the effective date. | | | | | |

## Discount tiers
| Tier | Annual container-days | Discount on base day rate | Condition |
| T0 | 0 - 7,999 | 0.00% | none |
| T1 | 8,000 - 19,999 | 3.50% | contract of at least 12 months |
| T2 | 20,000 - 44,999 | 6.00% | contract of at least 12 months |
| T3 | 45,000 - 89,999 | 9.25% | CFO approval needed |
| T4 | 90,000 and above | 12.00% | CFO and CEO approval needed |
| NOTE A | Discounts apply to base day rates only, never to surcharges or lift moves. | | |
| NOTE B | Pharma customers are capped at 8.00% irrespective of tier (GDP audit cost recovery). | | |
| NOTE C | Payment later than 45 days from invoice date drops the customer by one tier for the following quarter. | | |
| NOTE D | A prepaid annual commitment adds 0.75 percentage points on top of the tier discount. | | |
| NOTE E | Tiers are reassessed on 1 April each year on the previous calendar year container-days. | | |
